            <contributor xml:id="respStmt_996c3985">
               <persName role="composer" xml:id="persName_id8fed3fa0">Johann Adolph Scheibe</persName>
            </contributor>
            <history xml:id="history_idc724e4c4">
               <p xml:id="idm60">The cantata, which is only listed in the Breitkopf auction catalogue of 1836, has presumably not survived; the catalogue does not provide any detailed information on the work. It should be noted that it does not occur in the earlier sales catalogues, though it is likely that the cantata was obtained from the estate of <persName xml:id="idm61" auth.uri="http://www.viaf.org" auth="VIAF" role="">Carl Gotthelf Gerlach</persName> in 1761.</p>
            </history>
